"Io" load
"Base64" load
Io::@println open

[*"a" ord call print*]
[*"\n" print*]
[*97 chr call print*]
[*"1010" Integer::from-bin call @println*]

"Sun" Base64::b64encode call
@println

"Su" Base64::b64encode call
@println

"Hello im rayden" Base64::b64encode call
@println

"SGVsbG8gaW0gcmF5ZGVu" Base64::b64decode call
@println
